      "id": 227496,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-05-17T15:57:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Lore Forge was in town this week and we made a ton of progress on the rules and playtesting! At this point, you'll see a very close to final version of the Prime War rules at Gen Con with very preliminary art and graphic design. We are currently planning on having the game ready to send to the printer in Q1 2020.</p>\n<p>I definitely agree that you'll see Winds of Winter before a new Sentinel Tactics game, since we do not plan on releasing any more Sentinel Tactics. However, I am fairly confident that Prime War will be released before Winds of Winter!</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:01:42.669Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 1,
      "reads": 8,
      "readers_count": 7,
      "score": 6.6,
